# Inputs of the qwen3.8-27b-heretic-ara-nvfp4 conversion, each pinned by repository revision and
# sha256. Columns: sha256, local path (under the work directory), source. run.sh fetches every line
# and refuses to convert unless all of them match. A source "inputs:<file>" is a tracked file here.
#
# catplusplus/Qwen3.8-27B-heretic-ara-NVFP4-MTP (Apache-2.0): a Heretic ARA abliteration of
# Qwen3.8-27B (its card names coder3101/Qwen3.8-27B-heretic-ara) quantized with llm-compressor in
# the exact layout of unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-NVFP4, the official NVFP4 recipe's quantized source: NVFP4
# MLP in layers 0-55, FP8 rows for attention, GDN, layers 56-63 MLP and the output head. Embedding,
# norms and Vision are BF16. It serves as both the base (--model) and the quantized source.
# MTP head: model_mtp.safetensors, which the card says was copied from unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-NVFP4. Its
# bytes equal heretic-org/Qwen3.8-27B-heretic-ara's model-auxiliary.safetensors (same sha256).
